		<h2 class="wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold">Making Turmeric Powder from Fresh Roots</h2>
		<div class="wprm-spacer" style="height: 5px;"></div>
		<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">This neon-bright spice has a distinctive flavor that's used frequently in Indian cuisine. You can make your own turmeric powder at home from turmeric roots for a fresher product.</span></div>
