					<li class="comment even thread-even depth-1" id="comment-349675">
						<div class="comment_header">
							<span class="avatar"></span>
							<span class="comment_author">DANimal Sinneway</span>
							<span class="comment_date">Nov 19, 2025 @ 4:44</span>
						</div>
						<div class="comment_text" id="comment-body-349675">
<p>I have been using Turmeric for years but lately it’s not easily available in the stores so I’m going to start growing my own turmeric and other herbs to save money and keep my supplies fresh and well stocked!.<br />
Thank you for your very helpful and informative advice on how to achieve my goal!. Sincerely yours<br />
DANimal</p>
						</div>
						<div class="comment_footer">
							<a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-349675" data-commentid="349675" data-postid="12321" data-belowelement="comment-body-349675" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to DANimal Sinneway" aria-label="Reply to DANimal Sinneway">Reply</a>
