		<div class="sidebar">
<div class="widget widget_text" id="text-88">			<div class="textwidget"><p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-22910 size-full" src="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/xKrisB-21.jpg" alt="image of Kris Bordessa" width="300" height="300" srcset="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/xKrisB-21.jpg 300w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/xKrisB-21-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/xKrisB-21-96x96.jpg 96w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<p>Aloha! I’m Kris Bordessa, author, hobby farmer, gardener, chicken wrangler, and eternal experimenter.</p>
<p>If you&#8217;re ready to shake up your pantry routine and shift from boxed to homemade, be sure to check out my latest project, <a href="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/attainable-sustainable-pantry/"><em><strong>Attainable Sustainable Pantry </strong></em></a>(National Geographic Books).</p>
<p><a href="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/attainable-sustainable-pantry/"><img decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-33239 size-full" src="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/attainable-pantry-cover-for-site-1.jpg" alt="cover of Attainable Sustainable Pantry book, featuring numerous pantry items, collage style, on a light green background." width="450" height="572" /></a></p>
<p>My earlier book, <a href="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/book/"><em><strong>Attainable Sustainable: The Lost Art of Self-Reliant Living</strong></em></a> (also from National Geographic Books) was awarded the <strong>best how-to book of 2020</strong> by the <strong>American Society of Journalists and Authors</strong>.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/book/"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-17817 alignnone" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20450%20573'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="cover of attainable sustainable book" width="450" height="573" data-lazy-src="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/new-Attainable-Sustainable-cover-flat.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-17817 alignnone" src="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/new-Attainable-Sustainable-cover-flat.jpg" alt="cover of attainable sustainable book" width="450" height="573" /></noscript></a></p>
<p>Here at Attainable Sustainable, I encourage readers to embrace a more self-reliant lifestyle, one small step at a time.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://attainable-sustainable.myflodesk.com/yoy3had0rh">Subscribe for email updates</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/about/">Read more</a></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
		</div><div class="widget widget_dpsp_top_shared_posts" id="dpsp_top_shared_posts-2"><h3 class="widget_title">Reader Favorites</h3><div class="dpsp-top-shared-post"><a class="dpsp-top-shared-post-thumbnail" href="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/save-your-shells/" title="Using Eggshells for Plants in the Vegetable Garden"><img width="300" height="300" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20300%20300'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="Eggshells filled with soil and growing tomato seedlings." decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-96x96.jpg 96w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6.jpg 1200w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" data-lazy-src="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-300x300.jpg" /><noscript><img width="300" height="300" src="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-300x300.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image" alt="Eggshells filled with soil and growing tomato seedlings." decoding="async" srcset="https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.attainable-sustainable.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/eggshells-6-768x7